        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `upload_object.py` that uploads a file or byte stream to managed object storage, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use AWS S3 as the managed object storage service. The code will include the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with S3, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
